== #link("https://steamcommunity.com/workshop/filedetails/?id=3020755032")[Antistasi Ultimate - Mod]

- *Type:* Mechanics
- *Mod ID:* `3020755032`
- *Dependencies:* [#link("https://steamcommunity.com/workshop/filedetails/?id=450814997")[CBA_A3]]
- *Description:* A persistent cooperative guerilla warfare game mode. Capture an island from occupying forces using guerilla tactics — ambushes, resource caches, and building public support. Features dynamic AI aggression, faction templates for RHS/CUP/3CB, and ACE/TFAR/ACRE integration.
- *System Impact:* Complete gameplay framework replacing the standard mission structure. Introduces persistent economy, resource management, and territory control mechanics.
- *Verified:* 2025-06-17
]

