== #link("https://steamcommunity.com/workshop/filedetails/?id=1858070328")[LAMBS_RPG]

- *Type:* Mechanics
- *Mod ID:* `1858070328`
- *Dependencies:* [#link("https://steamcommunity.com/workshop/filedetails/?id=450814997")[CBA_A3]]
- *Description:* AI suppression, flanking, and tactical movement enhancement. AI reacts to suppressive fire, calls out contacts, and uses bounding overwatch.
- *System Impact:* Changes AI tactical behavior. AI will seek cover when suppressed, reposition when outflanked, and coordinate assaults.
- *Verified:* 2025-06-17
]

